# Dev-local, regenerate on demand (tools/export-replay-fixture.ts --resample25hz):
# too large to commit, only feeds SwingTuningSearch.mc's `make tuning-search`.
source/motion/RecordedFixture*Tuning.mc
# e2e screenshot-diff artifacts (see docs/e2e-testing.md) - baselines under
# tools/e2e/baselines/ ARE committed, just not these failure-debugging diffs.
tools/e2e/.diffs/

# Coverage runs write these into the working tree. `rafiki coverage` also
# rewrites monkey.jungle to point sourcePath at bin/coverage - harmless in
# CI's throwaway checkout, but it clobbers the real file when run locally
# against a bind-mounted repo. If a build suddenly cannot find
# '$.MaceClubsApp', check monkey.jungle first.
cov.log
coverage-*.log
bin/coverage/
